@page "/"
@attribute [Authorize]

<PageTitle>Glitter Admin</PageTitle>

<div class="page-header">
    <h1><span class="glitter-brand">Glitter</span> Admin</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">관리자 콘솔 · 왼쪽 메뉴에서 작업을 선택하세요.</p>
</div>

<div class="row g-3" style="max-width:720px">
    <div class="col-sm-6">
        <a href="reports" class="text-decoration-none">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-1">신고 처리</h5>
                    <p class="card-text text-muted small mb-0">접수된 신고를 검토하고 리뷰를 조치합니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </a>
    </div>
    <div class="col-sm-6">
        <a href="spotify" class="text-decoration-none">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-1">Spotify 상태</h5>
                    <p class="card-text text-muted small mb-0">레이트리밋(429) 및 응답 캐시 상태를 확인합니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </a>
    </div>
    <div class="col-sm-6">
        <a href="admins" class="text-decoration-none">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-1">관리자</h5>
                    <p class="card-text text-muted small mb-0">관리자 계정과 감사 로그를 관리합니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
